          %p (Note that, up to zero addenda, the sum above is again countable. Moreover, once we have defined countably affine, note that the pushforward map is countably affine.)
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒢
